kiosk-shell: add [shell] client-size=WxH option

The XPI panel physically displays only the top-left 800x480 of the
(black-padded) 1920x792 mode that stabilizes the LT9611 PCR lock.
Let kiosk-shell advertise a fixed client size and anchor surfaces at
the output's top-left instead of centering, so clients keep rendering
at panel size while the scanout runs the padded mode.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [product-specific panel quirk]

